the index member when a concurrent insert recreates the value\n\nThe orphan cleanup removed the member unconditionally, so an InsertEntry\nlanding between FindEntry and the ZRem left a live value with no index\nmember, invisible to listings until another InsertEntry on that path.\nUpdateEntry does not re-add it, so the loss persisted.\n\nRestore the member when the value is present again after the removal.\nThe value key and the directory index key hash to different slots, so a\nLua script or MULTI over both is not available to the cluster store.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e6b61d682e2defba3eaf4e245e11a335ed7582e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/git/trees/8e6b61d682e2defba3eaf4e245e11a335ed7582e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/git/commits/6c8fde6642cd428e884cc9c9d88c9aaa189c4bf1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/commits/6c8fde6642cd428e884cc9c9d88c9aaa189c4bf1","html_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/commit/6c8fde6642cd428e884cc9c9d88c9aaa189c4bf1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/commits/6c8fde6642cd428e884cc9c9d88c9aaa189c4bf1/comments","author":{"login":"petedodd-pd","id":232547300,"node_id":"U_kgDODdxj5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232547300?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petedodd-pd","html_url":"https://github.com/petedodd-pd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petedodd-pd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petedodd-pd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petedodd-pd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petedodd-pd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petedodd-pd/subscriptions","organizations_u